<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Are the Terms of DaRon Holmes II’s Contract?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Holmes signed his rookie contract on July 9, 2024, four years and <strong>$15.20m</strong> with <strong>$9.66m</strong> guaranteed. Denver exercised the club option on this season in October 2025.</p>
<p>One option remains, on 2027-28, with a deadline of November 2, 2026. He tore an Achilles tendon in his first summer league game and missed the whole of his rookie season, so the contract has paid him for longer than he has played.</p>

