</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Holmes’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$3.9m</strong>, derived from his <strong>$9.66m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played three seasons at Dayton and was 21 when Denver drafted him 22nd in 2024. He turns 25 in August.</p>

