<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/daron-holmes-ii/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/daron-holmes-ii/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Nuggets Paying DaRon Holmes II in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holmes earns $3.37m in 2026-27, twelfth on the Denver payroll and his third season under contract. It rises from $3.22m last year. His career earnings come to $9.66m. The salary is 1.55% of Denver’s $217.46m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for DaRon Holmes II Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The last club option, on 2027-28, has a deadline of November 2, 2026. If Denver exercises it he reaches restricted free agency in 2028 at 26, with a full picture of what the Achilles injury left behind."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does DaRon Holmes II Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $3.37m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Are the Terms of DaRon Holmes II’s Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holmes signed his rookie contract on July 9, 2024, four years and $15.20m with $9.66m guaranteed. Denver exercised the club option on this season in October 2025. One option remains, on 2027-28, with a deadline of November 2, 2026. He tore an Achilles tendon in his first summer league game and missed the whole of his rookie season, so the contract has paid him for longer than he has played."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is DaRon Holmes II Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holmes’s net worth is estimated at around $3.9m, derived from his $9.66m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played three seasons at Dayton and was 21 when Denver drafted him 22nd in 2024. He turns 25 in August."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is DaRon Holmes II on a Rookie Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holmes is paid $3.37m because he went 22nd in 2024, and the rookie scale sets what that slot earns whether a player appears or not. He has been paid $9.66m so far for parts of two seasons of basketball."}}]}</script>
